        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Plants: Dieffenbachia, Carlina, Carlina corymbosa\n- People: David Bowman\n- Concepts: plant taxonomy, botanical naming\n\nFacts:\n- Dieffenbachia is a genus of tropical flowering plants in the family Araceae.\n- Carlina is a genus of flowering plants in the family Asteraceae.\n- David Bowman is the person after whom the species Dieffenbachia bowmanii is named.\n- Carlina corymbosa, also called Clustered Carline Thistle, is a herbaceous perennial plant in the genus Carlina and the family Asteraceae.",
